### Get all users. Optional email parameter.
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/users

### Get user by id

GET http://localhost:3000/auth/users/1


### Create user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testing@est.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Delete user by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/auth/4

### Update user by id
PATCH http://localhost:3000/auth/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "aaaaa"
}
